1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,240
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Yaponiyaning hayotiy hayolari va odob-axloq qoidalari. Yaponlar buni qilmaydilar.

2
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,740
Sahna 1: Yapon tangalari va hamyonning ogʻirligi / Yaponiya tangalari va hamyon

3
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:15,874
Yaponiya sayohatim juda qiziqarli boʻldi.

4
00:00:15,897 --> 00:00:18,548
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku.

5
00:00:18,571 --> 00:00:24,805
Lekin Yaponiyaga kelishdan oldin bilmoqchi boʻlgan narsalarim bor edi.

6
00:00:24,828 --> 00:00:27,167
Qanday narsalar?

7
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,925
Pul haqida.

8
00:00:29,948 --> 00:00:31,882
Pulmi?

9
00:00:31,905 --> 00:00:37,582
Ha. Yapon tangalari juda koʻp ekan.

10
00:00:37,605 --> 00:00:39,644
Shunday, ha.

11
00:00:39,668 --> 00:00:48,239
1 yen, 5 yen, 10 yen, 50 yen, 100 yen va 500 yen tangalar bor.

12
00:00:48,262 --> 00:00:54,196
Ha. Mening mamlakatimda esa kupyuralar koʻp.

13
00:00:54,219 --> 00:00:57,485
Masalan, 1 dollarlik kupyura bor.

14
00:00:57,508 --> 00:01:02,042
Ha. Shuning uchun hamyon ogʻir boʻlmaydi.

15
00:01:02,065 --> 00:01:06,065
Yaponiyada hamyoningiz ogʻirlashdimi?

16
00:01:06,087 --> 00:01:12,454
Ha. Mening hamyonim Yaponiyada juda ogʻirlashdi.

17
00:01:12,477 --> 00:01:14,521
Nega?

18
00:01:14,544 --> 00:01:20,357
Har kuni avtomat doʻkonlardan ichimlik sotib oldim.

19
00:01:20,381 --> 00:01:23,275
Avtomat doʻkonlar juda qulay ekan.

20
00:01:23,298 --> 00:01:29,865
Ha. Lekin men har doim 1000 yenlik kupyura ishlatardim.

21
00:01:29,888 --> 00:01:32,587
Shuning uchun qaytim pul chiqardi.

22
00:01:32,611 --> 00:01:38,777
Ha. 100 yen va 500 yenlik tangalar koʻpayib ketdi.

23
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,093
Tangalar koʻpayib ketadi-ku.

24
00:01:43,117 --> 00:01:47,721
Ha. Mening hamyonim tangalar bilan toʻlib ketgan edi.

25
00:01:47,744 --> 00:01:49,997
Ogʻir boʻlgan-ku.

26
00:01:50,021 --> 00:01:54,240
Ha. Shalimning biroz pastga tushib ketdi.

27
00:01:54,263 --> 00:01:57,330
Bu qiyin boʻlgan-ku.

28
00:01:57,353 --> 00:02:03,805
Ha. Shuning uchun Yaponiyaga kelishdan oldin buni bilmoqchi edim.

29
00:02:03,828 --> 00:02:05,565
Nima?

30
00:02:05,588 --> 00:02:09,440
Kichik tanga sumkasi kerak boʻladi.

31
00:02:09,464 --> 00:02:12,268
Faqat tangalar uchun moʻljallangan hamyon, shundaymi?

32
00:02:12,291 --> 00:02:18,188
Ha. Bunday sumka boʻlsa, oddiy hamyon yengil boʻladi.

33
00:02:18,212 --> 00:02:20,454
Juda qulay ekan.

34
00:02:20,478 --> 00:02:26,044
Ha. 100 yenlik doʻkonlarda ham chiroyli sumkalar topish mumkin.

35
00:02:26,067 --> 00:02:30,243
Ha. Har xil dizaynlar bor.

36
00:02:30,267 --> 00:02:34,667
Ha. Men buni bilmas edim.

37
00:02:34,690 --> 00:02:39,664
Sayohatdan oldin bilsangiz, yaxshi tayyorgarlik koʻrish mumkin.

38
00:02:39,687 --> 00:02:44,663
Ha. Bu juda muhim hayol ekan.

39
00:02:44,687 --> 00:02:53,696
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsiflar va eng yaxshi izohdan yuklab olish mumkin.

40
00:02:53,696 --> 00:02:55,196
Sahna 2: Yaponiyadagi axlat qutilarining yetishmasligi / Yaponiyada axlat qutilarining kamligi

41
00:02:55,196 --> 00:03:02,407
Puldan tashqari, Yaponiyaga kelishdan oldin bilmoqchi boʻlgan boshqa narsalaringiz bormi?

42
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:04,120
Ha.

43
00:03:04,144 --> 00:03:07,477
Koʻchalardagi axlat qutilari haqida.

44
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,594
Axlat qutilari?

45
00:03:09,618 --> 00:03:11,585
Ha.

46
00:03:11,608 --> 00:03:16,774
Yapon koʻchalarida axlat qutisi deyarli yoʻq.

47
00:03:16,797 --> 00:03:18,597
Shunday, ha.

48
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:21,787
Deyarli yoʻq ekan.

49
00:03:21,810 --> 00:03:28,423
Men birinchi marta Yaponiyaga kelganimda, juda hayratlandim.

50
00:03:28,446 --> 00:03:31,925
Axlatni tashlamoqchi boʻldingizmi?

51
00:03:31,949 --> 00:03:33,749
Ha.

52
00:03:33,772 --> 00:03:38,373
Mazali shirinlik sotib olib, tashqarida yedim.

53
00:03:38,396 --> 00:03:42,466
Keyin axlatni tashlamoqchi boʻldim.

54
00:03:42,489 --> 00:03:46,856
Ammo, axlat qutisi yo'q ekan-ku.

55
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,578
Ha.

56
00:03:48,602 --> 00:03:54,335
Vokzal va do‘konlar yaqinida axlat qutisini uzoq izladim.

57
00:03:54,358 --> 00:03:57,125
Qiyin bo‘lgan-ku.

58
00:03:57,148 --> 00:03:59,007
Ha.

59
00:03:59,031 --> 00:04:02,210
Nega axlat qutisi yo‘q?

60
00:04:02,234 --> 00:04:08,600
Avval, xavfsizlik uchun shahardagi axlat qutilarini olib tashlashgan.

61
00:04:08,623 --> 00:04:10,957
Xavfsizlik uchunmi?

62
00:04:10,980 --> 00:04:12,780
Ha.

63
00:04:12,803 --> 00:04:15,680
Maxsus sababi bor.

64
00:04:15,703 --> 00:04:17,675
Tushunarli.

65
00:04:17,698 --> 00:04:22,531
Shuning uchun hamma o‘z axlatini uyiga olib ketadi-ku.

66
00:04:22,554 --> 00:04:24,209
Ha.

67
00:04:24,232 --> 00:04:25,643
Ha, shunday.

68
00:04:25,667 --> 00:04:30,400
Lekin axlat qutisiga o‘xshash quti ko‘rdim.

69
00:04:30,423 --> 00:04:32,860
Qayerda ko‘rding?

70
00:04:32,884 --> 00:04:36,684
Avtomatlar yonida.

71
00:04:36,707 --> 00:04:39,073
U yerda quti bor edi.

72
00:04:39,096 --> 00:04:42,163
Aa, shu narsa.

73
00:04:42,186 --> 00:04:45,986
Lekin u axlat qutisi emas.

74
00:04:46,009 --> 00:04:47,776
E?

75
00:04:47,799 --> 00:04:49,819
Shundaymi?

76
00:04:49,842 --> 00:04:51,575
Ha.

77
00:04:51,598 --> 00:04:54,484
U qayta ishlash qutisi.

78
00:04:54,507 --> 00:04:56,841
Qayta ishlashmi?

79
00:04:56,864 --> 00:04:58,706
Ha.

80
00:04:58,729 --> 00:05:02,162
Faqat qutilar va plastik butilkalarni solish kerak.

81
00:05:02,185 --> 00:05:04,041
Bundaymi.

82
00:05:04,065 --> 00:05:06,882
Shirinliklar paketini solish mumkinmi?

83
00:05:06,905 --> 00:05:08,475
Ha.

84
00:05:08,499 --> 00:05:12,032
Shirinliklar axlatini solish mumkin emas.

85
00:05:12,055 --> 00:05:14,508
Tushunarli.

86
00:05:14,531 --> 00:05:16,531
Odob-axloq masalasi-ku.

87
00:05:16,554 --> 00:05:18,448
Ha.

88
00:05:18,472 --> 00:05:22,722
Yaponlar hammasi bu qoidalarga rioya qiladi.

89
00:05:22,745 --> 00:05:28,243
Lekin axlatni qo‘lda uzoq ushlab turish yoqmaydi-ku.

90
00:05:28,266 --> 00:05:31,233
Sumka iflos bo‘ladi.

91
00:05:31,256 --> 00:05:32,893
Ha.

92
00:05:32,917 --> 00:05:38,150
Shuning uchun ham Yaponiyaga kelishdan oldin bilsam edi.

93
00:05:38,173 --> 00:05:40,232
Qanday narsalar?

94
00:05:40,256 --> 00:05:45,464
Sumkangizga kichik plastik paket solib qo‘ying.

95
00:05:45,487 --> 00:05:48,687
Xarid qilganda beradigan paket.

96
00:05:48,710 --> 00:05:50,282
Ha.

97
00:05:50,306 --> 00:05:53,715
O‘sha paketga axlatni soling.

98
00:05:53,739 --> 00:05:56,472
So‘ngra og‘zini yoping.

99
00:05:56,495 --> 00:06:00,098
Shunda sumka iflos bo‘lmaydi.

100
00:06:00,121 --> 00:06:01,759
Ha.

101
00:06:01,782 --> 00:06:05,582
Mehmonxonaga qaytib, axlatni tashlang.

102
00:06:05,605 --> 00:06:08,572
Ajoyib fikr!

103
00:06:08,595 --> 00:06:10,240
Ha.

104
00:06:10,264 --> 00:06:14,197
Bu Yaponiyaga sayohatning asosiy qoidalari.

105
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:21,325
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o‘chirilishi mumkin.

106
00:06:21,325 --> 00:06:22,825
3-qism: Yapon hammomlaridagi qiyinchiliklar / Challenges with Japanese Toilets

107
00:06:22,825 --> 00:06:26,836
Axlatdan keyin hammom masalasiga o‘tamiz.

108
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:28,509
Hammommi?

109
00:06:28,532 --> 00:06:32,783
Yapon hammomlari juda toza ekan.

110
00:06:32,806 --> 00:06:36,497
Ha, rostdan ham toza.

111
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:40,687
Lekin biroz muammo bo‘ldi.

112
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:42,843
Qanday narsalar?

113
00:06:42,866 --> 00:06:47,939
Qo‘limni yuvgandan keyin artadigan qog‘oz topilmadi.

114
00:06:47,963 --> 00:06:51,211
Aa, qog‘oz sochiq.

115
00:06:51,235 --> 00:06:57,413
Ha. Mening mamlakatimda doimo qog‘oz sochiq bo‘ladi.

116
00:06:57,436 --> 00:06:59,770
Bundaymi.

117
00:06:59,793 --> 00:07:03,870
Yapon hammomlarida kamdan-kam uchraydi.

118
00:07:03,893 --> 00:07:08,665
Qo‘lni quritadigan moslama ham ishlamay qoldi.

119
00:07:08,689 --> 00:07:14,622
Ha. Bu kasallik oldini olish uchun hozir ishlata olmaymiz.

120
00:07:14,645 --> 00:07:19,249
Shuning uchun hoʻl qoʻlimni shimim bilan artib oldim.

121
00:07:19,273 --> 00:07:23,040
He-he, bu biroz muammoli boʻldi-ku.

122
00:07:23,063 --> 00:07:27,496
Ha. Yaponlar buni qanday qiladi?

123
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:32,154
Hamma oʻzining roʻmolchasi yoki sochiqini olib yuradi.

124
00:07:32,178 --> 00:07:35,986
Erkaklar ham roʻmolcha olib yuradimi?

125
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:40,810
Ha. Albatta, erkaklar ham olib yuradi.

126
00:07:40,833 --> 00:07:42,866
Bundaymi.

127
00:07:42,889 --> 00:07:47,547
Yaponiya kelishdan oldin buni bilishni xohlardim.

128
00:07:47,571 --> 00:07:52,104
Har kuni kichik roʻmolchani sumkangizga solib yuring.

129
00:07:52,127 --> 00:07:58,860
Ha. Men Yaponiyada juda koʻp yoqimli mini sochiqlar sotib oldim.

130
00:07:58,883 --> 00:08:00,952
Yaxshi ekan!

131
00:08:00,976 --> 00:08:04,421
Sovgʻa sifatida ham juda yaxshi keladi.

132
00:08:04,445 --> 00:08:09,022
Ha, doʻstlarim ham juda xursand boʻlishdi.

133
00:08:09,045 --> 00:08:13,245
Hojatxonada boshqa qiyinchiliklar bormi?

134
00:08:13,268 --> 00:08:19,538
Ha. Eski bogʻdagi hojatxonada sovun yoʻq edi.

135
00:08:19,562 --> 00:08:24,045
A, sovunsiz hojatxonalar ham boʻladi-ku.

136
00:08:24,069 --> 00:08:28,310
Qoʻlimni yuvib boʻlmadi, shuning uchun juda qiynaldim.

137
00:08:28,333 --> 00:08:33,206
Oʻsha paytda choʻntak sovuni juda qulay boʻlardi.

138
00:08:33,229 --> 00:08:36,031
Choʻntak sovuni deb?

139
00:08:36,054 --> 00:08:42,188
Ha. Kichik qogʻoz sovunlar yoki suyuq sovunlar bor.

140
00:08:42,211 --> 00:08:44,983
Ularni qayerdan sotib olish mumkin?

141
00:08:45,006 --> 00:08:49,822
100 yen doʻkonlari yoki dorixonalarda sotib olish mumkin.

142
00:08:49,846 --> 00:08:54,413
100 yen doʻkoni deb? Juda arzon ekan!

143
00:08:54,436 --> 00:09:00,369
Ha. Kichkina boʻlgani uchun sumkaga solib yurish ham ogʻir emas.

144
00:09:00,392 --> 00:09:02,327
Yaxshi ekan!

145
00:09:02,350 --> 00:09:06,444
Buni ham Yaponiyaga kelishdan oldin bilishni xohlardim.

146
00:09:06,468 --> 00:09:11,315
Shunday. Tayyorgarlik koʻrish xotirjamlik beradi.

147
00:09:11,338 --> 00:09:12,838
4-Sahna: Koʻchada ovqatlanish odobi / Koʻchada ovqatlanish qoidasi

148
00:09:12,838 --> 00:09:18,275
Keyin ovqatlanish odobi haqida. Odob-axtiqmi?

149
00:09:18,298 --> 00:09:21,075
Nima muammo boʻldi?

150
00:09:21,099 --> 00:09:25,379
Koʻchada yurib ovqatlanish.

151
00:09:25,402 --> 00:09:29,441
A, koʻchada yurib ovqatlanish deysizmi?

152
00:09:29,464 --> 00:09:31,237
Ha.

153
00:09:31,261 --> 00:09:36,395
Mening mamlakatimda odatiy hol, lekin Yaponiyada mumkin emasmi?

154
00:09:36,418 --> 00:09:38,253
Ha.

155
00:09:38,276 --> 00:09:42,710
Yaponiyada koʻchada yurib ovqatlanish man etiladi.

156
00:09:42,733 --> 00:09:46,933
Nega koʻchada yurib ovqatlanish mumkin emas?

157
00:09:46,956 --> 00:09:52,834
Boshqalarning kiyimlarini ifloslantiradi, odobli emas.

158
00:09:52,857 --> 00:09:54,591
Kiyimlar deb?

159
00:09:54,614 --> 00:09:59,380
Albatta, ketchup yoki boshqa narsa toʻkilganda katta muammo boʻladi-ku.

160
00:09:59,403 --> 00:10:01,097
Ha.

161
00:10:01,121 --> 00:10:05,754
Shuning uchun sotib olgan doʻkon yaqinida ovqatlanish kerak.

162
00:10:05,777 --> 00:10:08,311
Doʻkon yonida deysizmi?

163
00:10:08,334 --> 00:10:10,340
Ha, shunday.

164
00:10:10,363 --> 00:10:14,101
Shu yerda hammasini yeb boʻlgandan keyin yurasiz.

165
00:10:14,125 --> 00:10:16,058
Tushunarli.

166
00:10:16,081 --> 00:10:19,118
Kombinilar yonida ham mumkinmi?

167
00:10:19,141 --> 00:10:20,675
Ha.

168
00:10:20,698 --> 00:10:25,498
Kombini yonida yoki yaqinidagi skameykada ovqatlang.

169
00:10:25,521 --> 00:10:27,979
Muzqaymoq-chi?

170
00:10:28,002 --> 00:10:32,619
Muzqaymoqni ham doʻkon oldida yeyish kerak.

171
00:10:32,642 --> 00:10:34,455
Tushunarli.

172
00:10:34,479 --> 00:10:36,812
Shu yerda yeyiladi.

173
00:10:36,835 --> 00:10:40,802
Keyin, poyezd odobi ham muhim.

174
00:10:40,826 --> 00:10:42,959
Poyezdmi?

175
00:10:42,982 --> 00:10:47,382
Yaponiya poyezdlari juda ham tinch edi.

176
00:10:47,405 --> 00:10:49,206
Shunday, ha.

177
00:10:49,229 --> 00:10:52,431
Hamma juda ham tinch.

178
00:10:52,455 --> 00:10:57,327
Men poyezd ichida qoʻngʻiroq qilishni xohlardim.

179
00:10:57,351 --> 00:11:00,284
Voy, telefon qildingizmi?

180
00:11:00,307 --> 00:11:06,401
Yo'q. Hech kim bilan gaplashmadim, shuning uchun telefon qilmadim.

181
00:11:06,424 --> 00:11:08,558
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

182
00:11:08,581 --> 00:11:12,028
Poyezdda telefon qilish taqiqlanadi.

183
00:11:12,051 --> 00:11:15,018
Mobil telefon bilan nima qilish kerak?

184
00:11:15,041 --> 00:11:18,060
Ovoz chiqmaydigan rejimga o'tkazing.

185
00:11:18,084 --> 00:11:20,503
Manner rejimi, shundaymi?

186
00:11:20,526 --> 00:11:23,023
Ha, shunday.

187
00:11:23,047 --> 00:11:26,489
Musiqani karnaydan eshitish ham yaramaydi, shundaymi?

188
00:11:26,513 --> 00:11:29,446
Ha, yaramaydi.

189
00:11:29,469 --> 00:11:32,202
Naushnikdan foydalaning.

190
00:11:32,225 --> 00:11:37,592
Mening davlatimdan butunlay farq qiladi, shuning uchun boshida hayron bo'ldim.

191
00:11:37,615 --> 00:11:41,651
Lekin, tinch poyezd yoqdi, shundaymi?

192
00:11:41,674 --> 00:11:45,132
Ha, juda yoqdi.

193
00:11:45,155 --> 00:11:49,048
Tinch, shuning uchun yaxshi uxladim.

194
00:11:49,071 --> 00:11:50,671
Haha, shunday.

195
00:11:50,694 --> 00:11:53,961
Ko'p odamlar yaxshi uxlayapti, shundaymi?

196
00:11:53,984 --> 00:11:55,584
Ha.

197
00:11:55,607 --> 00:12:00,240
Yapon poyezdlari juda xavfsiz, shuning uchun xotirjam bo'lish mumkin.

198
00:12:00,263 --> 00:12:03,673
Ha, rostdan ham shunday.

199
00:12:03,697 --> 00:12:08,297
Odob-axloqni bilganingizda, sayohatingiz yanada qiziqarli bo'ladi.

200
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,899
Shunday, ha.

201
00:12:09,922 --> 00:12:14,219
Odob-axloqqa rioya qilib, yaxshi sayohat qiling.

202
00:12:14,242 --> 00:12:15,742
5-Sahna: Internet va Wi-Fi bilan bog'liq muammolar / Sayohat paytida Internet va Wi-Fi bilan bog'liq muammolar

203
00:12:15,742 --> 00:12:20,309
Poyezddan keyin internet haqida gaplashamiz.

204
00:12:20,332 --> 00:12:22,665
Internetmi?

205
00:12:22,688 --> 00:12:28,124
Ha, sayohat paytida juda qiynaldim.

206
00:12:28,147 --> 00:12:30,681
Nega?

207
00:12:30,704 --> 00:12:35,002
Men Yaponiyaning aeroportiga yetib keldim.

208
00:12:35,025 --> 00:12:39,993
Shundan so'ng, darhol mehmonxonaga borishni xohlardim.

209
00:12:40,016 --> 00:12:42,249
Ha, shunday.

210
00:12:42,272 --> 00:12:46,506
Lekin, poyezdni almashtirishni bilmasdim.

211
00:12:46,529 --> 00:12:51,095
Smartfoningizdan qidirib ko'rmadingizmi?

212
00:12:51,118 --> 00:12:55,392
Aeroportning bepul Wi-Fi dan foydalanmoqchi edim.

213
00:12:55,416 --> 00:12:59,482
Lekin, umuman ulanmadi.

214
00:12:59,505 --> 00:13:06,239
Aa, aeroportning Wi-Fi si ba'zan ulanmaydi.

215
00:13:06,262 --> 00:13:11,201
Ha, shuning uchun poyezd yo'nalishini bilmadim.

216
00:13:11,225 --> 00:13:15,025
Bu juda qiynalardi.

217
00:13:15,047 --> 00:13:18,781
Ha, juda xavotirda edim.

218
00:13:18,804 --> 00:13:24,837
Internetga Yaponiyaga kelishdan oldin tayyorgarlik ko'ring.

219
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:26,956
